# arrival — the block that opens a visit names somebody when anybody is in view
#
# At seed 42 the playground opens the Test Yard on the rack and a wolf print, and stops there: nobody.
# Two people stand in the yard, so one more observation is appended to the same block, its choice
# narrowed to the people: the farmer. Without the rule the block ends on the print. Which objects the
# playground draws first moves with any earlier draw (the observation groups moved it once).
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Yard" --period dawn

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60
advance 12 180
expect four toes and a pad
expect shifts to the farmer
quit
